{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_23\">Problem 23</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 23\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The set of solutions of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/0844c43febdea7e651ca2b605148964d04ea877f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}\\left( a^2-15a\\right)=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"156\" height=\"22\" /> consists of\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/d/60d40ebf790ffe3bc1291c21658a4a9b1b0f343b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{two integers } \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{one integer and one fraction}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{two irrational numbers }\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{two non-real numbers} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{no numbers, that is, the empty set}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"1180\" height=\"17\" /> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Understand that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/f/f3f8c314c547a9af15d065db4c6a391e1727f72c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}\\left(x\\right)=y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" /> can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/0/df084b09ee1beb4ff6e964191a45084cbaf655eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 10^y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>By applying this fact to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/0844c43febdea7e651ca2b605148964d04ea877f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}\\left( a^2-15a\\right)=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"156\" height=\"22\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f733308610dc0fce0265b7c2d83fe2327d8b741f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2-15a = 10^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"115\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>We can use factoring methods to bring us to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/6/b86f162e4e59c289643b44e04f49b6daf3ed5a4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-20)(a+5)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"18\" />, which, as each binomial produces one integer solution, gives us a solution set of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/4/d0420b8ff30f9b635de3f2e0bf0af2f6b4cea24f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf{(A) }two integers}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"136\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<t